Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "go build -o /tmp/sff-bin/SoftwareFactoryFactory . && export PATH=/tmp/sff-bin:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type "SoftwareFactoryFactory"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 18s
